  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial contribution to assist the inhabitants of the Gaza</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Finan&#x10D;n&#xFD; pr&#xED;spevok na pomoc obyvate&#x13E;om p&#xE1;sma Gazy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Poskytnutie okam&#x17E;itej potravinovej pomoci obyvate&#x13E;om Gazy prostredn&#xED;ctvom WFP, ktor&#xE1; poskytuje pomoc obyvate&#x13E;om Gazy nielen poskytovan&#xED;m priamej potravinovej pomoci, z&#xE1;rove&#x148; distribuuje potravinov&#xE9; pouk&#xE1;&#x17E;ky, za ktor&#xE9; si obyvatelia Gazy m&#xF4;&#x17E;u k&#xFA;pi&#x165; potraviny v obchodoch a pek&#xE1;r&#x148;ach zazmluvnen&#xFD;ch zo strany WFP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing immediate food aid to the people of Gaza through the WFP, which provides aid to the people of Gaza not only by providing direct food aid, but also distributes food vouchers with which Gazans can buy food in shops and bakeries contracted by the WFP.</narrative>
  </description>
